    "not_proven": [
      "No C++ call stack was captured; unique C++ root-cause attribution remains an inference from matching source and observations.",
      "ZIP files contain manifests and receipts, not the executable SDK/WASM/gateway bytes; executable hashes are reported by CI, not independently rehashed locally.",
      "The primary browser executable version is not separately captured in the selected per-case audit; report identifies Playwright1.63.0 and chromium project. Full job logs can verify installed browser version.",
      "The failed source case has no late-owner proof or completed cancellation receipt because the original native wait did not finish.",
      "Source-head full UI and Architecture job conclusions were still pending in the jobs snapshot.",
      "The base six-case pass does not replace the source six-case failure or prove the race fixed."
